# Brewfile — the live state of this machine.
#
# Identical copies live at ~/dotfiles/Brewfile and ~/scripts/Brewfile; edit one,
# copy to the other.
#
#   $ brew bundle install --file=~/dotfiles/Brewfile
#   $ brew bundle check   --file=~/dotfiles/Brewfile --verbose
#
# Ordering note: the `cargo`, `go`, `uv` and `npm` entries at the bottom need
# their toolchains on PATH first. See ~/dotfiles/LANGUAGES.md — run that first.

